#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.1.1.rst:4
msgid "v5.1.1"
msgstr "v5.1.1"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.1.1.rst:6
msgid ""
"v5.1.1 is a macOS point release. Every tool OpenMV IDE runs on a Mac now "
"ships as a native Apple Silicon build, so firmware updates, the language "
"server, and the other bundled tools keep working on macOS releases that no "
"longer include the Intel translation layer. Nothing changes on Windows or "
"Linux. It is built on Qt Creator 14.0.2 and bundles firmware v5.0.1."
msgstr ""
"v5.1.1 adalah rilis titik untuk macOS. Setiap alat yang dijalankan OpenMV "
"IDE di Mac kini hadir sebagai build Apple Silicon native, sehingga pembaruan"
" firmware, language server, dan alat lain yang disertakan tetap berfungsi "
"pada rilis macOS yang tidak lagi menyertakan lapisan terjemahan Intel. Tidak"
" ada perubahan di Windows maupun Linux. Dibangun di atas Qt Creator 14.0.2 "
"dan menyertakan firmware v5.0.1."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.1.1.rst:15
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Di halaman ini"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.1.1.rst:18
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Sorotan"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.1.1.rst:20
msgid ""
"**Native Apple Silicon tools** -- the bundled dfu-util, picotool, bossac, "
"STM32CubeProgrammer, the NXP flashing tools, FFmpeg, the Python language "
"server, and the Node.js runtime used by GitHub Copilot are now native arm64 "
"builds on Apple Silicon Macs. The Intel builds of these tools failed on "
"recent macOS releases, which surfaced as firmware updates and other tools "
"failing with errors such as \"query failed\" (`36d4d9cf615 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/36d4d9cf615>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Alat native Apple Silicon** -- dfu-util, picotool, bossac, "
"STM32CubeProgrammer, alat flashing NXP, FFmpeg, language server Python, dan "
"runtime Node.js yang digunakan GitHub Copilot yang disertakan kini merupakan"
" build arm64 native di Mac Apple Silicon. Build Intel dari alat-alat ini "
"gagal pada rilis macOS terbaru, yang muncul sebagai kegagalan pembaruan "
"firmware dan alat lain dengan galat seperti \"query failed\" (`36d4d9cf615 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/36d4d9cf615>`__)."

